\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces DIF landscape across cohort definitions. ETS~C denotes the percentage of items with $|\Delta _{\mathrm  {MH}}| \geq 1.5$. C\% (web-clean) is the DIF-C flagging rate among items classified as web-clean by \citet  {li2024contamination}. Enrichment is the ratio of observed to expected overlap between DIF flags and web-overlap labels. Dashes (--) indicate comparisons where Li et al.\ labels are not applicable.}}{7}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
